# Driver step 1: channel 1 plays a C major scale up (order 0, default instrument 1), then
# down (order 1, instrument 2 with length enabled). Every note is followed by a note off
# (C00: volume 0 and retrigger). Channels 2-4 play the empty pattern 00.
ticks_per_row 06

pulse 1 00 80 F0            # 50% duty, volume F, no envelope, no length
pulse 2 80 C0 A1            # length enabled, 75% duty, volume A fading

order 01 00 00 00
order 02 00 00 00

pattern 00

pattern 01
00 C-4 . ...
02 --- . C00
04 D-4 . ...
06 --- . C00
08 E-4 . ...
0A --- . C00
0C F-4 . ...
0E --- . C00
10 G-4 . ...
12 --- . C00
14 A-4 . ...
16 --- . C00
18 B-4 . ...
1A --- . C00
1C C-5 . ...
1E --- . C00

pattern 02
00 C-5 2 ...
02 --- . C00
04 B-4 . ...
06 --- . C00
08 A-4 . ...
0A --- . C00
0C G-4 . ...
0E --- . C00
10 F-4 . ...
12 --- . C00
14 E-4 . ...
16 --- . C00
18 D-4 . ...
1A --- . C00
1C C-4 . ...
1E --- . C00
